WEBVTT

NOTE Authored chapter summaries; full spoken transcript is demo-transcript.txt.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Can you make this app lose a note in three moves?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
1. Sync notes   2. Add a note

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.000
3. Release the response → the note disappears

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
BugArcade · Play a real bug. Understand it. Test the fix.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Muse proposed the actions. The browser executed them.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Four model actions → three reproducible moves

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
The assertion stays locked. The verifier decides.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The exact regression fails on the buggy app.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Same moves, fixed app: the note survives.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:05.500
Three buggy failures · three fixed passes · same assertion

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:19.000
Captured playback · authored gallery · live uploads disabled

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Start with a bug you can break. Finish with a test that catches it.
